                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If the Congressional Budget Office is wrong that 16 million Americans will lose health insurance under the GOP bill, it's also wrong that the bill's Medicaid/ACA changes will save $1 trillion.  \n\nYou only get the savings Republicans are touting if you deny that many people care.",
