                "text": "To be clear -- this was a vote to legalize some of the massive Elon Musk cuts to USAID (including for anti-AIDS programs) and to defund PBS and NPR.\n\nAnd it won only because four Democrats were absent.\n\nThere may be legitimate health-related reasons here, but this is not good.",
