                "text": "Lisa Murkowski knows this bill takes health care and food from people who need it. And Senators are supposed to care about the country, not just their state.\n\nIs she really going to vote to screw 340 million Americans because 700K Alaskans are exempted? https://t.co/nkd8OnMaLy",
