                "text": "A terrible idea: \n\nMedicare will follow private insurers in requiring prior approval - by an AI algorithm - for some procedures. The companies running the tech will be paid more the more claims they deny.\n\nAnd the program is being piloted in New Jersey.\nhttps://t.co/uP0vZ67gdf",
