                "text": "Ciattarelli said \"it's a waste of tax dollars\" for NJ to sue the federal government.\n\nReally? When Trump violates the Constitution to deny funding for our schools, health care, and infrastructure that Congress lawfully enacted, you're just going to submit without a fight?",
