                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "What's at stake in the gov't shutdown debate today?\n\nIt's not whether Democrats or Republicans win or lose, or who gets blamed.\n\nIt's whether Congress will let the cost of health insurance rise by thousands of $ a year for millions of Americans when Obamacare subsidies expire. 1/ https://t.co/hWs3icplK2",
