                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The second issue is that the Trump administration is saying \"no matter what amount of money Congress provides for health care, roads, veterans, etc., we don't have to spend it.\" Why would any member of Congress vote for a budget the president is saying he'll ignore? 3/",
