                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This is silly. \n\nBut if you're really just concerned about one line on p. 57 of the Democrats' bill, why not just ask them to take that line out, and then agree to extend the health insurance benefits for Americans, reopen the government, and call it a day?",
